<title>USA: FlightMasters/SeaMaster opens LA offices.</title>
<headline>FlightMasters/SeaMaster opens LA offices.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minnesota 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. logistics provider FlightMasters/SeaMasters said it has opened two offices in Los Angeles, including one at Los Angeles International Airport, to serve the southern California market.</p>
<p>&quot;Based on our plan to grow to 30 U.S. offices, Los Angeles is a critical location as a main international gateway for both air and sea,&quot; president Richard McCrady Jr said in a statement.</p>
<p>Jose &quot;Butch&quot; Claudio was named district manager for the Los Angeles region. -- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+5017</p>
